WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.584
Your keynote starts at nine.

00:00:01.987 --> 00:00:03.759
Breakfast is still being served.

00:00:04.157 --> 00:00:07.028
Who closes the doors
and gives the speaker the microphone?

00:00:07.426 --> 00:00:09.102
It starts with the business goal.

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.740
We build the program around your audience,

00:00:11.904 --> 00:00:14.789
name the decision makers
and rehearse the handoffs.

00:00:15.187 --> 00:00:17.825
Our team coordinates catering, décor,

00:00:18.141 --> 00:00:20.751
multimedia, staffing and logistics.

00:00:21.149 --> 00:00:23.388
The caterer knows when service pauses.

00:00:23.786 --> 00:00:26.932
The audio lead knows exactly
when the speaker steps up.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.050
We produce more than two hundred
and fifty small

00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:33.937
and midsize events each year,
alongside our corporate productions.

00:00:34.336 --> 00:00:37.550
That experience matters
when two teams need to move as one.

00:00:37.948 --> 00:00:41.959
With full production,
VNV-Q gives your team a shared schedule,

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:45.352
registration, check-in
and crew assignments.

00:00:45.751 --> 00:00:50.325
Access is included within the agreed scope
and can support future events.

00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:54.514
Whether you're planning a customer
launch or an employee celebration,

00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:57.330
bring us your audience, date and goals.

00:00:57.729 --> 00:01:00.874
Request a production proposal
from VNV Events.
